  "qHtml": "<p>…the Elements of Primary Health Care. Mention the …</p>",
  "aHtml": "<p><strong>Elements of Primary Health Care</strong> (Alma-Ata Declaration 1978 – eight essential elements):</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Education</strong> concerning prevailing health problems and the methods of preventing and controlling them.</li>\n<li><strong>Promotion of food supply and proper nutrition.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Adequate supply of safe water and basic sanitation.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Maternal and child health care, including family planning.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Immunisation</strong> against the major infectious diseases.</li>\n<li><strong>Prevention and control of locally endemic diseases.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Appropriate treatment of common diseases and injuries.</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Provision of essential drugs.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p><em>Bangladesh:</em> PHC is delivered through the Essential Services Package (ESP) at community clinics, union health centres and UHCs; Bangladesh has also adopted PHC-based Universal Health Coverage (UHC) as the goal in its Health, Population and Nutrition Sector Programme (HPNSP).</p>",
  "qText": "…the Elements of Primary Health Care. Mention the …",
  "aText": "Elements of Primary Health Care (Alma-Ata Declaration 1978 – eight essential elements): Education concerning prevailing health problems and the methods of preventing and controlling them. Promotion of food supply and proper nutrition. Adequate supply of safe water and basic sanitation. Maternal and child health care, including family planning. Immunisation against the major infectious diseases. Prevention and control of locally endemic diseases. Appropriate treatment of common diseases and injuries. Provision of essential drugs. Bangladesh: PHC is delivered through the Essential Services Package (ESP) at community clinics, union health centres and UHCs; Bangladesh has also adopted PHC-based Universal Health Coverage (UHC) as the goal in its Health, Population and Nutrition Sector Programme (HPNSP)."
